                <div x-show="faqOpen === 1" class="mt-3 text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed border-t border-black/[0.04] dark:border-white/5 pt-3">
                    Yo'q, mutlaqo kerak emas. StoreBox oddiy va qulay qilib yaratilgan. Siz atigi do'kon nomini kiritasiz va mahsulotlarni rasmi bilan yuklaysiz, qolgan hamma narsa avtomatik tarzda ishga tushadi.
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="white-glass-card rounded-2xl p-4 cursor-pointer" @click="faqOpen = faqOpen === 2 ? 0 : 2">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm">
                    <span>Mening o'z shaxsiy domenim (.uz) bo'lsa, uni ulay olamanmi?</span>
                    <span x-text="faqOpen === 2 ? '−' : '+'" class="text-base font-mono"></span>
                </div>
                <div x-show="faqOpen === 2" x-cloak class="mt-3 text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed border-t border-black/[0.04] dark:border-white/5 pt-3">
                    Ha! Standart holda sizga bepul `sizningdokon.storebox.uz` beriladi. Agar xohlasangiz, istalgan `.uz` yoki xalqaro domeningizni bir zumda sozlashingiz mumkin.
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="white-glass-card rounded-2xl p-4 cursor-pointer" @click="faqOpen = faqOpen === 3 ? 0 : 3">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm">
                    <span>To'lovlar to'g'ridan-to'g'ri mening hisobimga tushadimi?</span>
                    <span x-text="faqOpen === 3 ? '−' : '+'" class="text-base font-mono"></span>
                </div>
                <div x-show="faqOpen === 3" x-cloak class="mt-3 text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed border-t border-black/[0.04] dark:border-white/5 pt-3">
                    Ha, StoreBox savdolaringizdan 0% komissiya oladi. Barcha to'lovlar Payme, Click yoki Uzum orqali bevosita sizning hisob raqamingizga tushadi.
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <!-- 9.5. SECTION: CONSULTATION LEAD FORM (ROBO.UZ STYLE)     -->
    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <section class="py-16 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
        <div class="white-glass-card rounded-[32px] p-6 sm:p-12 shadow-2xl border border-violet-500/20 relative overflow-hidden">
            <!-- Background Glow -->
            <div class="absolute -right-20 -bottom-20 w-64 h-64 bg-violet-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

            <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-violet-100 dark:bg-violet-950/60 text-violet-700 dark:text-violet-300 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
                    Mutaxassis maslahati
                </span>
                <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-neutral-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
                    Hali ham savollaringiz bormi?
                </h3>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 mt-2">
                    Ma'lumotlaringizni qoldiring va StoreBox mutaxassisi 15 daqiqa ichida siz bilan bog'lanib, biznesingiz uchun eng yaxshi yechimni tavsiya qiladi.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Form or Success message -->
            <div x-show="!consultationSubmitted">
                <form @submit.prevent="consultationSubmitted = true" class="space-y-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                        <!-- Name -->
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 mb-1.5">Ismingiz *</label>
                            <input 
                                type="text" 
                                required
                                x-model="consultationName"
                                placeholder="Aliyev Vali" 
                                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-white/5 border border-black/[0.08] dark:border-white/10 text-xs text-neutral-900 dark:text-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-violet-500"
                            />
                        </div>

                        <!-- Phone -->
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 mb-1.5">Telefon raqamingiz *</label>
                            <input 
                                type="tel" 
                                required
                                x-model="consultationPhone"
                                placeholder="+998 90 123 45 67" 
                                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-white/5 border border-black/[0.08] dark:border-white/10 text-xs font-mono text-neutral-900 dark:text-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-violet-500"
                            />
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                        <!-- Company / Brand -->
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 mb-1.5">Kompaniya yoki brendingiz nomi</label>
                            <input 
                                type="text" 
                                x-model="consultationStore"
                                placeholder="Masalan: Gold Burger" 
                                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-white/5 border border-black/[0.08] dark:border-white/10 text-xs text-neutral-900 dark:text-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-violet-500"
                            />
                        </div>

                        <!-- Niche -->
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 mb-1.5">Faoliyat sohasi</label>
                            <select 
                                x-model="consultationNiche"
                                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-neutral-800 border border-black/[0.08] dark:border-white/10 text-xs text-neutral-900 dark:text-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-violet-500"
                            >
                                <option value="restaurant">Restoran, Kafe & Fast-Food</option>
                                <option value="store">Onlayn Do'kon & Elektronika</option>
                                <option value="fashion">Kiyim, Butik & Aksessuarlar</option>
                                <option value="services">Xizmatlar & Boshqa</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Submit Button -->
                    <div class="pt-3 text-center">
                        <button 
                            type="submit"
                            class="w-full sm:w-auto px-10 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-violet-600 hover:bg-violet-700 text-white font-black text-xs shadow-lg hover:shadow-violet-600/30 transition-all cursor-pointer"
                        >
                            Mutaxassis bilan bog'lanish ➔
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </form>
            </div>

            <!-- Success State -->
            <div x-show="consultationSubmitted" x-cloak class="text-center py-8 space-y-4">
                <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-950/60 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-xl mx-auto shadow-sm">
                    ✓
                </div>
                <h4 class="text-xl font-black text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">
                    Arizangiz muvaffaqiyatli qabul qilindi!
                </h4>
                <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 max-w-md mx-auto leading-relaxed">
                    Rahmat, <span class="font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white" x-text="consultationName"></span>! Mutaxassisimiz 15 daqiqa ichida siz kiritgan raqamga bog'lanadi.
                </p>
                <div class="pt-2">
                    <button 
                        type="button" 
                        @click="consultationSubmitted = false" 
                        class="text-xs font-bold text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400 hover:underline cursor-pointer"
                    >
                        Yangi ariza qoldirish
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <!-- 10. APPLE MINIMAL FOOTER                                 -->
    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <footer class="py-12 border-t border-black/[0.06] dark:border-white/10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-violet-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-[10px]">
                    S
                </div>
                <span class="font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">StoreBox Studio 2.0</span>
                <span>© 2026 Barcha huquqlar himoyalangan.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-6 font-semibold">
                <a href="https://t.me/storebox_support" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-violet-600 dark:hover:text-violet-400 transition-colors">Telegram Yordam</a>
                <a href="{{ app_site_url }}/dashboard/" class="hover:text-violet-600 dark:hover:text-violet-400 transition-colors">Boshqaruv Paneli</a>
                <a href="{{ app_site_url }}/dashboard/register/" class="hover:text-violet-600 dark:hover:text-violet-400 transition-colors">Do'kon Ochish</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

</div>
{% endblock %}
